  "version": 7,
  "_note": "Built from real captures of apply.commonapp.org (see captures/). Selectors are Common App's stable question IDs (#text_ques_NNN / #radioGroupNNN, formControlName) with label fallbacks. Mapped: Personal info, Phone, Legal sex, Birthplace/Citizenship (+ citizenship status radio), GPA, and Family. mat-radio fields fill by clicking the option whose label matches the stored value (exact match preferred). DOB uses MM/DD/YYYY. Sensitive/derived fields are requiresConfirm.",
